{"title":"Collage Blankets","description":"\u003cdiv id=\"clgcategorytop\"\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eOur collage blankets are truly special personalized gifts! Choose from Woven or our other premium fine fabrics like fleece, plush or sherpa. Collage blankets are available now in several popular sizes.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eOrdering is simple with the design tool featured with our \u003cstrong\u003eQuick Collage products,\u003c\/strong\u003e or;\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eJust let us do all the work for you by choosing one of our \u003cstrong\u003eFull Service Collage products\u003c\/strong\u003e. A collage blanket makes a unique \u0026amp; thoughtful gift.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\r\n\u003c\/div\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-30x40","title":"Quick Collage Polar Fleece Blanket-6 Image Template- 30\"x40\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur basic option - soft, smooth and lightweight. 1\/16 inch thick, dye sublimation imprinted. Makes a great throw or picnic blanket. This option allows you to quickly and easily design a 6 image collage with our ready to use template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30\" x 40\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Anti Pill 260 GSM Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Low Pile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Brushed on both sides for soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41979081667,"sku":"30x40RGF-CLG","price":39.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-quick-photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-30-x40-1.jpg?v=1506966118"},{"product_id":"photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-60-x-80","title":"Quick Collage Polar Fleece Blanket-12 Image Template- 60\" x 80\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur basic option - soft, smooth and lightweight at only 1\/8 inch thick, with dye sublimated imprint. Makes a great throw or picnic blanket. This option allows you to quickly and easily design a 12 image collage with our ready to use template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60\" x 80\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Anti Pill 365 GSM Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Low Pile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Brushed on both sides for soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\