ong\u003e\u003cem\u003eShips out\u003c\/em\u003e in 3 to 5 business days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42272430339,"sku":"50x60SHRPA-CLG","price":59.36,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-50-x-60-heavy-weight-photo-quick-collage-sherpa-throw-blanket-1.jpg?v=1501186883"},{"product_id":"60-x-80-heavy-weight-photo-quick-collage-sherpa-throw-blanket","title":"60\" x 80\" Heavy Weight Quick Collage Sherpa Throw Blanket -12 Image Template","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet a stunning soft blanket that combines quality and comfort with the Heavy Weight Sherpa Lined Sublimated Throw. The top side features silken faux micro mink and the inside is a lusciously soft faux sheepskin Sherpa layer. The whip stitch border gives the blanket a rustic flair. It's made using 100% microfiber polyester fabric. This option allows for you to quickly and easily set up a 12 image collage using our template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60\" x 80\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e