003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50\" x 59\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e 100% Polyester Plush Microfiber Front, Water-Repellent Oxford Lin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42273148803,"sku":"50x59PICNIC-CLG","price":74.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-quick-collage-water-repellent-outdoor-picnic-blanket-50-x-59-1.jpg?v=1506966159"},{"product_id":"hanging-kit-rings-with-clips","title":"Hanging Kit, Rings with Clips","description":"\u003cp\u003eUse this set of clips to turn any photo blanket into a wall hanging. This set of 7 rings with clips allows you to turn any blanket and curtain rod into a hanging tapestry.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Set of 7 rings with clips.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eHanging rod not included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":37759049155,"sku":"28002","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-hanging-kit-rings-with-clips-1.jpg?v=1506961058"},{"product_id":"photo-blanket-rod-kit-for-hanging-22-56","title":"Photo Blanket Rod Kit for hanging 22\"-56\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eDo you wish you could turn your photo blanket into a wall hanging? Now you can! All you have to do is to purchase this picture blanket hanging accessory. It comes with Solid Rings and Clips for Hanging and Displaying an Afghan or Throw.\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":37757500739,"sku":"PT91001ROD","price":39.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-photo-blanket-rod-kit-for-hanging-22-56-1.jpg?v=1506962523"},{"product_id":"full-service-photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-30x40","title":"Full Service Photo Collage Polar Fleece Blanket - 30\"x40\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur basic option - soft, smooth and lightweight. 1\/16 inch thick, dye sublimation imprinted. Makes a great throw or picnic blanket. This option allows for you to quickly and easily set up a 6 image collage!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30\" x 40\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Anti Pill 260 GSM Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Low Pile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Brushed on both sides for soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum No. Images:\u003c\/strong\u003e Allows up to 6 images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis is a full-service collage layout set up by our art team. Proofing is included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42805874115,"sku":"30x40RGF-CLGFS","price":69.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-full-service-photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-30-x40-1.jpg?v=1501708220"},{"product_id":"full-service-photo-collage-plush-fleece-blanket-30-x-40","title":"Full Service Photo Collage Plush Fleece Blanket - 30\" x 40\"","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA slightly snugglier option than our Polar Fleece – thicker and fuzzier. 1\/4 inch thick, dye sublimation imprinted. Great for chilly plane cabins or car rides.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e30\" x 40\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAnti Pill 400 GSM Coral fleece (100% Polyester)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eFuzzy material that is softer than cashmere.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum No. Images:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAllows for up to 6 images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis is a full-service collage layout set up by our art team. Proofing is included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42805984963,"sku":"30x40PLF-CLGFS","price":79.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-full-service-photo-collage-plush-fleece-blanket-30-x-40-1.jpg?v=1501708230"},{"product_id":"hd-woven-full-service-collage-blanket-54x38-medium","title":"HD Woven Full Service Collage Blanket 54\"x38\" (Medium)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA traditional woven blanket with full color detail. Three-layer woven, dye sublimation imprinted. Perfect for hanging out on the couch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e54\" x 38\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ePoly\/Cotton, 3-layer Woven Blanket\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eUltra soft and comfy.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTexture Comparisons:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eSoft ribbed knit feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum No. Images:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAllows for up to 6 images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis is a full-service collage layout set up by our art team. Proofing is included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42806132419,"sku":"54x38HDW-CLGFS","price":104.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-hd-woven-full-service-collage-blanket-54-x38-medium-1.jpg?v=1506961104"},{"product_id":"copy-of-jacquard-woven-quick-collage-blanket-54-x-38-small","title":"Jacquard Woven Full Service Collage Blanket - 54\" x 38\" (Small)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA traditional woven blanket created by turning your image into a loom pattern. Three-layer woven, 100% cotton. An instant heirloom!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe size indicated includes the fringes. The dimensions do not mean the image itself will be that exact size and additionally there is a 5-7% variance in size due to woven nature of product and cotton shrinkage factors.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e54\" x 38\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e100% cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eJacquard Weaving with 100% Cotton Yarn\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-4 Weeks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImage is converted to a 6-color pattern and woven into a blanket. Best suited for closeup images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum No. Images:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAllows for up to 4 images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis is a full-service collage layout set up by our art team. Proofing is included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42807414595,"sku":"54x38JQW-CLGFS","price":114.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-jacquard-woven-full-service-collage-blanket-54-x-38-small-1.jpg?v=1506961515"},{"product_id":"jacquard-woven-full-service-collage-blanket-60-x-54-medium","title":"Jacquard Woven Full Service Collage Blanket - 60\" x 54\" (Medium)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA traditional woven blanket created by turning your image into a loom pattern. Three-layer woven, 100% cotton. An instant heirloom!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe size indicated includes the fringes. The dimensions do not mean the image itself will be that exact size and additionally there is a 5-7% variance in size due to woven nature of product and cotton shrinkage factors.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 60\u003c\/span\u003e\" x 54\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e100% cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eJacquard Weaving with 100% Cotton Yarn\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-4 Weeks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImage is converted to a 6-color pattern and woven into a blanket. Best suited for closeup images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum No. Images:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAllows for up to 6 images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis is a full-service collage layout set up by our art team. Proofing is included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42807473859,"sku":"60x54JQW-CLGFS","price":134.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-jacquard-woven-full-service-collage-blanket-60-x-54-medium-1.jpg?v=1506961629"},{"product_id":"photo-collage-beach-towel-30-x-60","title":"Photo Quick Collage Beach Towel -6 Image Template- 30\" x 60\"","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA towel unlike what you're used to – made from absorbent microfiber, this soft and plush towel is thinner than a