a.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42303463619,"sku":"60TWL-CIRCULAR","price":59.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-towels-60-round-quick-collage-beach-towel-1.jpg?v=1501187386"},{"product_id":"60-x-72-two-person-terry-velour-quick-collage-beach-towel","title":"60\" x 72\" Two-Person Terry-Velour Quick Collage Beach Towel -12 Image Template","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOur largest beach towel yet, perfect for couples! A perfect gift for the spring and summer months.  This option allows you to quickly and easily set up a 12 image collage using our template and your images!\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 60\u003c\/span\u003e\" x 72\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e75% Polyester, 25% Cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eSuper Soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTexture:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ePoly-velour front, high-end plush cotton backing\u003c\/li\